null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_67","text":"Will you be allowed to open up the garden like that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_68","text":"I thought the garden was like the shelter, in that it isn't accessible to the general public.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_69","text":"I'll say that it's being opened per a special directive from Lobelia.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_70","text":"Since all the plants in the Ark are artificial, it'll be a rare opportunity for people to see real flowers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_71","text":"I'm sure that if I open the garden,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_72","text":"there will be a lot of interest.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_73","text":"If they're wondering why the garden is now accessible,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_74","text":"I'll tell them it's because Lobelia gave the go-ahead.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_75","text":"We can attribute it all to her. Say how that in granting permission to open the garden, she hopes that","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_76","text":"the people will be invigorated by glimpsing upon these evergreen flowers and witnessing their zest for life.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_77","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_77","text":"Are you sure that's a good idea? Doing all this under Syuen's name behind her back?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_78","text":"It's not a great option, but it's the best one we have available to us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_79","text":"Lobelia has her sights set on the garden right now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_80","text":"If we asked her for more time, there's no way she would be receptive to it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_81","text":"At the same time, we can't sit back and do nothing either.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_82","text":"That's right! Otherwise, nothing will change.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_83","text":"If we open the garden to the public, everyone's eyes will be on it, and Lobelia won't be able to shut it down.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_84","text":"Blossom, Sunflower, Sea Lavender.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_85","text":"Will you help me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_86","text":"Of course!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_87","text":"I've been all in ever since we went out to find the Aurora Bloom.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"nero","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_88","text":"*Meow* I'm in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_89","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_89","text":"Yeah, I'll help.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_90","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_90","text":"We need to protect the garden.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_91","text":"Thank you. I'm so grateful to have all of you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_04_s_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_04_s_92","text":"Well then, what do you say we give Peach Blossom a call?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}